💡 Pro Tips:

✅ Use Multi-AZ for production workloads.
✅ Enable Performance Insights to troubleshoot DB performance.
✅ Use Read Replicas to scale reads — not for failover.
✅ Prefer Aurora for modern, scalable, cloud-native apps.
✅ Regularly rotate DB credentials using AWS Secrets Manager.
